# Hybrid Premium Gauge Implementation

Enhance the Analog gauges to match the high-end reference image provided by the user, featuring layered structures, glowing rings, and customizable inner digital displays.

## Proposed Changes

### [Component Name]
#### [MODIFY] [speedometer_painter.dart](file:///c:/projects/claude+antigravity/projects/car_dash/lib/presentation/painters/speedometer_painter.dart)
- Implement **Layered Backgrounds**: Outer neon ring, middle tick track with subtle depth, and central "hole".
- Implement **Premium Needle**: Tapered design with a subtle gradient and a glowing hub.
- Improve **Classic Variant**: Add high-density ticks and precise labeling.

### [Component Name]
#### [MODIFY] [futuristic_gauge.dart](file:///c:/projects/claude+antigravity/projects/car_dash/lib/presentation/widgets/futuristic_gauge.dart)
- Support **Center Slot**: Allow conditional rendering of different digital metrics in the gauge center.
- Add `centerMetric` property (e.g., speed, SOC, range).

### [Component Name]
#### [MODIFY] [gauge_mini_settings.dart](file:///c:/projects/claude+antigravity/projects/car_dash/lib/presentation/widgets/gauge_mini_settings.dart)
- Add **Inner Display** selection: A sub-menu to choose what appears in the center of Analog gauges.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- None (Visual UI focus).

### Manual Verification
- Deploy and verify the "Premium" look of the new Speedometer.
- Toggle between Futuristic, Classic, and Neon variants to see the layered improvements.
- Switch the central content (Inner Display) and verify it updates correctly.
